{"content_html": "<div>\n<figure><picture><!--[if IE 9]><video style=\"display: none;\"><![endif]--><!--[if IE 9]></video><![endif]--><img alt=\"editorial_uefa_com sporting_lisbon_v_manchester_united_ _uefa_champions_league_ _estadio_jose_alvalade.jpg\" src=\"https://static-images.vnncdn.net/vps_images_publish/000001/000003/2026/11/26/editorial-uefa-com-sporting-lisbon-v-manchester-united-uefa-champions-league-estadio-jose-alvalade-74.jpg?width=0&amp;s=aZQI5ioT2bnmfqPBDkMCHQ\"/></picture>\n<figcaption>Bruno Fernandes đối đầu đội bóng cũ</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure><picture><!--[if IE 9]><video style=\"display: none;\"><![endif]--><!--[if IE 9]></video><![endif]--><img alt=\"editorial_uefa_com sporting_lisbon_v_manchester_united_ _uefa_champions_league_ _estadio_jose_alvalade (1).jpg\" src=\"https://static-images.vnncdn.net/vps_images_publish/000001/000003/2026/11/26/editorial-uefa-com-sporting-lisbon-v-manchester-united-uefa-champions-league-estadio-jose-alvalade-1-75.jpg?width=0&amp;s=y5YMeSY5sFrjicW8F1ylNQ\"/></picture>\n<figcaption>Cơ hội của Zirkzee nhưng anh dứt điểm vọt xà</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure><picture><!--[if IE 9]><video style=\"display: none;\"><![endif]--><!--[if IE 9]></video><![endif]--><img alt=\"editorial_uefa_com sporting_lisbon_v_manchester_united_ _uefa_champions_league_ _estadio_jose_alvalade (2).jpg\" src=\"https://static-images.vnncdn.net/vps_images_publish/000001/000003/2026/11/26/editorial-uefa-com-sporting-lisbon-v-manchester-united-uefa-champions-league-estadio-jose-alvalade-2-76.jpg?width=0&amp;s=WIOIHq6V5raEusImZI9rVg\"/></picture>\n<figcaption>Pochettino chỉ đạo nhiệt huyết ngoài đường biên</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure><picture><!--[if IE 9]><video style=\"display: none;\"><![endif]--><!--[if IE 9]></video><![endif]--><img alt=\"editorial_uefa_com sporting_club_de_portugal_v_manchester_united_ _uefa_champions_league_2026_27_league_phase_md5.jpg\" src=\"https://static-images.vnncdn.net/vps_images_publish/000001/000003/2026/11/26/editorial-uefa-com-sporting-club-de-portugal-v-manchester-united-uefa-champions-league-2026-27-league-phase-md5-77.jpg?width=0&amp;s=KuJAsCXlueXOCOG3gIHbGA\"/></picture>\n<figcaption>Phút 30, Lammens cản phá được cú phạt đền của Suarez, sau khi Lisandro Martinez phạm lỗi trong vòng cấm</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure><picture><!--[if IE 9]><video style=\"display: none;\"><![endif]--><!--[if IE 9]></video><![endif]--><img alt=\"editorial_uefa_com sporting_club_de_portugal_v_manchester_united_ _uefa_champions_league_2026_27_league_phase_md5 (1).jpg\" src=\"https://static-images.vnncdn.net/vps_images_publish/000001/000003/2026/11/26/editorial-uefa-com-sporting-club-de-portugal-v-manchester-united-uefa-champions-league-2026-27-league-phase-md5-1-78.jpg?width=0&amp;s=8y7qtDpQbe8EJDebc79DqQ\"/></picture>\n<figcaption>Chỉ 3 phút sau, Sporting được hưởng quả penalty thứ hai. Lần này, Lammens không thể cản bước Suarez mở tỷ số</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure><picture><!--[if IE 9]><video style=\"display: none;\"><![endif]--><!--[if IE 9]></video><![endif]--><img alt=\"editorial_uefa_com sporting_club_de_portugal_v_manchester_united_ _uefa_champions_league_2026_27_league_phase_md5 (3).jpg\" src=\"https://static-images.vnncdn.net/vps_images_publish/000001/000003/2026/11/26/editorial-uefa-com-sporting-club-de-portugal-v-manchester-united-uefa-champions-league-2026-27-league-phase-md5-3-79.jpg?width=0&amp;s=rmfm7AJYXCO0NV6pw71aWA\"/></picture>\n<figcaption>Tiền đạo người Colombia ăn mừng</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure><picture><!--[if IE 9]><video style=\"display: none;\"><![endif]--><!--[if IE 9]></video><![endif]--><img alt=\"HX_5gfqXIAAgAQi.jpg\" src=\"https://static-images.vnncdn.net/vps_images_publish/000001/000003/2026/11/26/hx-5gfqxiaagaqi-80.jpg?width=0&amp;s=rzWLXvXaZf3poTzv5-8m6w\"/></picture>\n<figcaption>Cuối hiệp một, MU bị từ chối bàn thắng của Amad khi trọng tài cho rằng Tielemans trước đó đã phạm lỗi với hậu vệ Sporting</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure><picture><!--[if IE 9]><video style=\"display: none;\"><![endif]--><!--[if IE 9]></video><![endif]--><img alt=\"editorial_uefa_com sporting_cp_v_manchester_united_ _uefa_champions_league (3).jpg\" src=\"https://static-images.vnncdn.net/vps_images_publish/000001/000003/2026/11/26/editorial-uefa-com-sporting-cp-v-manchester-united-uefa-champions-league-3-126.jpg?width=0&amp;s=lM0EvVo8tmyGNcSqOBZQpQ\"/></picture>\n<figcaption>Bàn thắng của Amad không được trọng tài công nhận gây tranh cãi</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure><picture><!--[if IE 9]><video style=\"display: none;\"><![endif]--><!--[if IE 9]></video><![endif]--><img alt=\"editorial_uefa_com sporting_cp_v_manchester_united_ _uefa_champions_league (2).jpg\" src=\"https://static-images.vnncdn.net/vps_images_publish/000001/000003/2026/11/26/editorial-uefa-com-sporting-cp-v-manchester-united-uefa-champions-league-2-112.jpg?width=0&amp;s=Qdz81Z7q5_oqvCz_RKalGg\"/></picture>\n<figcaption>Sang hiệp hai, MU được hưởng 11m và Bruno Fernandes không bỏ lỡ cơ hội gỡ hòa 1-1</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure><picture><!--[if IE 9]><video style=\"display: none;\"><![endif]--><!--[if IE 9]></video><![endif]--><img alt=\"editorial_uefa_com sporting_club_de_portugal_v_manchester_united_ _uefa_champions_league_2026_27_league_phase_md5 (4).jpg\" src=\"https://static-images.vnncdn.net/vps_images_publish/000001/000003/2026/11/26/editorial-uefa-com-sporting-club-de-portugal-v-manchester-united-uefa-champions-league-2026-27-league-phase-md5-4-113.jpg?width=0&amp;s=lBap2wWhC9VBlL_two7BmQ\"/></picture>\n<figcaption>Lisandro chia vui với đồng đội</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure><picture><!--[if IE 9]><video style=\"display: none;\"><![endif]--><!--[if IE 9]></video><![endif]--><img alt=\"editorial_uefa_com sporting_cp_v_manchester_united_ _uefa_champions_league (1).jpg\" src=\"https://static-images.vnncdn.net/vps_images_publish/000001/000003/2026/11/26/editorial-uefa-com-sporting-cp-v-manchester-united-uefa-champions-league-1-114.jpg?width=0&amp;s=E9c1l1kM4sMeSD8DyqlCEg\"/></picture>\n<figcaption>Phút 50, Bruno Fernandes nâng tỷ số lên 2-1 với cú sút xa có phần may mắn</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure><picture><!--[if IE 9]><video style=\"display: none;\"><![endif]--><!--[if IE 9]></video><![endif]--><img alt=\"editorial_uefa_com sporting_club_de_portugal_v_manchester_united_ _uefa_champions_league_2026_27_league_phase_md5 (5).jpg\" src=\"https://static-images.vnncdn.net/vps_images_publish/000001/000003/2026/11/26/editorial-uefa-com-sporting-club-de-portugal-v-manchester-united-uefa-champions-league-2026-27-league-phase-md5-5-127.jpg?width=0&amp;s=wrSnJnmp_yCTmORAoVEYhQ\"/></picture>\n<figcaption>MU vùng lên đầu hiệp hai</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure><picture><!--[if IE 9]><video style=\"display: none;\"><![endif]--><!--[if IE 9]></video><![endif]--><img alt=\"editorial_uefa_com topshot fbl eur c1 sporting man_utd.jpg\" src=\"https://static-images.vnncdn.net/vps_images_publish/000001/000003/2026/11/26/editorial-uefa-com-topshot-fbl-eur-c1-sporting-man-utd-116.jpg?width=0&amp;s=XJxHg8jBOVGJ-cYPTe1Dog\"/></picture>\n<figcaption>Đến phút 80, Suarez gỡ hòa 2-2 sau sai lầm của thủ thành Lammens</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure><picture><!--[if IE 9]><video style=\"display: none;\"><![endif]--><!--[if IE 9]></video><![endif]--><img alt=\"editorial_uefa_com topshot fbl eur c1 sporting man_utd (1).jpg\" src=\"https://static-images.vnncdn.net/vps_images_publish/000001/000003/2026/11/26/editorial-uefa-com-topshot-fbl-eur-c1-sporting-man-utd-1-117.jpg?width=0&amp;s=vLSveaBbsTgngBxoe0itDA\"/></picture>\n<figcaption>Lammens và hậu vệ MU bực tức cho rằng Suarez đã phạm lỗi trước khi ghi bàn</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure><picture><!--[if IE 9]><video style=\"display: none;\"><![endif]--><!--[if IE 9]></video><![endif]--><img alt=\"HYAJtruXQAEH1He.jpg\" src=\"https://static-images.vnncdn.net/vps_images_publish/000001/000003/2026/11/26/hyajtruxqaeh1he-118.jpg?width=0&amp;s=g270vHmzKlh_d-0YHEXczQ\"/></pic